// Stormglass Commons character appearance H0/H1.
//
// H0 separates dermal profile, outfit skin, and presentation appearance.
// H1 promotes one identity-neutral faceless Craftfolk surface shell over the
// immutable MV-V3 rig/body witness. Every visible surface part, atlas region,
// LOD visibility rule, camera, benchmark, and claim boundary is authored here.
// The browser bridge may materialize and measure these declarations; it may
// not invent family identity, join a research seat, or rewrite MV-V3 through G.

